# Compos {zoom}

The Hackable Harness for Power Users

???

All the harnesses are wonderful. Claude Code was revolutionary. But the more we use them, the more we realise that the original naive conception of a chatbot was great, but it is a limited interface. Compos is an exploration of an alternative architecture for an AI agent harness. One built on the timeless UX of emacs, modernised for the agentic age.

---

<!-- transition: zoom; focus: on -->
## a wish list for a coding harness
As an AI-pilled maniac, I want my agent harness to
+ keep me close to my work 
+ help me to manage context
+ get better with time
