## The Three Paradigms

@screenshot of claude code

### 2. Work happens where where the intelligence is. You are elsewhere

You're watching the TUI, the files it is editing are far from you. Even the diff is far. You have to switch tabs or just watch everything stream by. 

You feel further and further from the code {step fade}

---

## The Three Paradigms

### Work, you and the intelligence are all in the same place.

